1	# Design Language: Paper – design, share, ship
2	
3	> Extracted from `https://paper.design/` on September 4, 2026
4	> 4925 elements analyzed
5	
6	This document describes the complete design language of the website. It is structured for AI/LLM consumption — use it to faithfully recreate the visual design in any framework.
