394	
395	### Common Transitions
396	
397	```css
398	transition: all;
399	transition: background-color 0.1s, box-shadow 0.1s;
400	transition: opacity 0.1s;
401	transition: opacity 0.15s;
402	transition: color, background-color, border-color, outline-color, text-decoration-color, fill, stroke, --tw-gradient-from, --tw-gradient-via, --tw-gradient-to;
403	transition: colors 0.15s, transform 0.15s;
404	transition: transform 1s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0, 1);
405	transition: opacity 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
406	transition: width 0.4s;
407	transition: opacity 0.4s, transform 0.4s;
408	```
