410	### Keyframe Animations
411	
412	**marquee**
413	```css
414	@keyframes marquee {
415	  0% { transform: translate(0px); }
416	  100% { transform: translateX(var(--marquee-offset)); }
417	}
418	```
419	
420	**cursor-reveal**
421	```css
422	@keyframes cursor-reveal {
423	  0% { opacity: 0; scale: 0.5; }
424	  100% { opacity: 1; scale: 1; }
425	}
426	```
